7/uploads/origins/dd0462de-d18a-4ffc-954f-87413e8aa9e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f7eb6725dd51e809fbc10ae2032f44ec 3x"}, "body": "daughter (of a good family)\n\nThank you for your help...!\nMy name is Uta Kotori!\n\nAlthough I am on hiatus, I would like to request an illustration from skeb to Ran-sama!\n\nI would like you to draw Uta Kotoriyu as you would like to see her, in the style of fan art.\nYou can change her outfit, hair style, etc.\n\nI would be very happy to receive any kind of illustration, since I love Mama's illustrations. 🫶🏻💕︎︎\n\nUsage》 《Purposes of use》 《Purposes of use》 《Purposes of use\nWe may use your illustrations in various situations such as singing, thumbnails, postings in X, merchandise, etc.\n\nIf there is a background, please separate the layers.\n\nWe understand that you are busy, so if it is difficult, please feel free to return it...!\n\nThank you very much.\n\nUta Kotori", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@pushixe/works/75", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1122831, "client_id": 3069281, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8880f379/uploads/origins/f295c240-ab66-42cf-80d8-b5b2da928d19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ca765abdf325c3a449a3f0500962425", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8880f379/uploads/origins/f295c240-ab66-42cf-80d8-b5b2da928d19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ca765abdf325c3a449a3f0500962425, https://si.imgix.net/8880f379/uploads/origins/f295c240-ab66-42cf-80d8-b5b2da928d19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2775a0a4f2d745551749178b564366db 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8880f379/uploads/origins/f295c240-ab66-42cf-80d8-b5b2da928d19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr